>Diverse Maps</strong>: Explore beautiful maps, each with its own challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your plane, keep it cool, and face every enemy in the air to become the top air combat hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Contents:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique levels and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay, each level lasts up to about 20 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different fighter jet models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable fighter jet colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ active skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ passive items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 unlockable achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Emergency Evasion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590390/d03e3ee71a114391c9947c549f226e27066b5f3e.jpg"},{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590390/b448cf81faddcef4b5f53c0a9c63199f8cbbb668.jpg"},{"name":"Victorious in Every Battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590390/be1df05a354c85ce706ce28b83d08c9785321a16.jpg"},{"name":"Wealth Pouring In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590390/34562f531960c230da4689fe7316bd2d83fd78e0.jpg"},{"name":"First Test of Strength","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590390/ce9b5a1cb9c10924f083d2f743623b3e89901c70.jpg"},{"name":"Initial Ocean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590390/90ec28afa7256112584b4bfd1c8808709001ef90.jpg"},{"name":"Sunset Coast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590390/110fe18cd9f06e